Figure 5.4 shows the performance example of the HFT. HFT will be able to measure the spectra (left plot) and cross section with great accuracy extending the \(p_{T}\) reach. Figure 5.4 (right) shows the two extreme scenarios of the flow parameter, \(v_{2}\). The error projections on \(v_{2}\) allow us to distinguish the

